  "source_review": {
    "definition": "Maximize ln|A-A|/ln|A+A| for2..512 distinct integers in[-1000000,1000000]. This raw ratio differs from T012 normalized ratio. Root checked explicit ordering reversal with n8/s26/d25 and its separated two-copy extension n16/s78/d75; they rank oppositely under the two objectives.",
    "human_source": "Gyarmati/Hennecart/Ruzsa May30 2008 manuscript section2 equations13-15, finite simplex vectors and projection weights. Frozen human m6L5 has462 elements, max555555, s8008,d39733 and exact ratio about1.1782049454. Asymptotic1.27155 is not claimed as this finite score.",
    "stronger_reference": "Root screened the same public formula family and requested correction: m7L4 has330 elements,s6435,d33111,max1198372; translating by-599186 fits[-599186,599186]. Exact ratio about1.1867965542. This locally instantiated published formula is not a separately tabulated literature score or new public record. Weaker frozen H remains unchanged.",
    "independent_verification": "Sorted all unordered-with-repetition sums and ordered differences, count value transitions. Independently enclose logarithms by exact rational atanh power series with110 terms and explicit geometric remainder; the resulting rational ratio enclosure lies inside every formal80-digit mpmath interval. No numerical sampling certificate.",
    "open_status": "Reviewed primary formula and subsequent experimental sources provide constructions, without a proof of maximum for this finite configuration. No global optimality or best-public absence claim inferred from a limited source search.",
    "initial_search_and_admission": "Standalone{0,1,3}initial ratio1.0860; generic traditional/evolution1.1287422798 without comparison reads. All five strict runs, whole-return claim invariance, duplicate damage, exact independent quantities, replay, cold export and failure controls passed."
  }
